== Trivia ==
* The Dev Diaries episodes "ALL ABOUT THE SPEAR" and "ALL ABOUT THE NAUTILUS" are the only proof of existence of the unreleased developer version [[Bedrock Edition Preview 26.0.43]] and an early build of [[Bedrock Edition 1.21.130]] respectively.
* In ''THE HORRORS OF MINECRAFT'', several [[add-on]]s are shown to demonstrate horror culture in the fandom. All of these had previously received promotions on [[Minecraft.net]].<ref>{{Mcnet|let-s-play-huggy-friends|Let's Play: Huggy & Friends|December 1, 2025|Staff}}</ref><ref>{{Mcnet|let-s-play--dwellers-2-0|LET’S PLAY: DWELLERS 2.0|July 7, 2025|[[Tom Stone]]}}</ref><ref>{{Mcnet|let-s-play-the-one-who-watches|LET’S PLAY: THE ONE WHO WATCHES|February 2, 2026|Staff}}</ref> 
** This continued after the video's release, with them being featured on the front page.<ref>{{Mcnet|minecraft-marketplace-spotlight|Marketplace Spotlight|March 17, 2026|[[James Nouch]]}}</ref>
* Alongside the release of ''Why Is That Squid Flying?'' was an article touching on many of the same topics.<ref>{{mcnet|minecrafts-top-10-bugs|Minecraft's Top 10 Bugs|May 19, 2025|[[Marsh Davies]]}}</ref>

